{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u300aPushing\u300b</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">is a game that can be played with just a mouse. The game is mainly based on 3D box pushing, with a total of 35 levels. Players need to move the white blocks to their destination within the specified number of times they need to move them. This game does not require players to complete one level before moving on to the next, but it recommends players to complete the levels in order.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game operation example</strong>\uff1a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Keep pressing the right mouse button and moving:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167480/extras/Mouse_action2.gif?t=1727594259\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Keep pressing the right button and moving the mouse, then left click on the block:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167480/extras/Mouse_action1.gif?t=1727594259\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Click the mouse on different positions of the block, and the block will move in different directions:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167480/extras/box_action.gif?t=1727594259\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The gameplay of pushing boxes:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167480/extras/JiChu.gif?t=1727594259\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Win\uff01","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3167480/d18b2c0c162dbe398e6b7de6e9b0d0125a42d8c6.jpg"},{"name":"1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3167480/4a172222